@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Cierre 6: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings/:transportOrderId/export (Exportación Excel y Descarga de Acta Oficial PDF)

actor "Usuario / Auditor / Jefe de Logística" as User
participant "App Web (Frontend)" as Web
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Closing Export Service" as Service
participant "Excel / PDF Engine\n(Spreadsheet & PDFKit)" as Engine
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "warehouse_closings DB\n(transport_order_warehouse_closings)" as WhClosingDB
participant "sales_items & products DB\n(transport_order_sales_items / products)" as SalesItemsDB
participant "collection_closings DB\n(transport_order_collection_closings)" as CollClosingDB
participant "payment_references DB\n(delivery_payment_references)" as PaymentsDB

== Flujo A: Exportar a Excel (.xls / Libro Completo o por Tab) ==

User -> Web: Clic en "Descargar Excel (Almacén / Cobranzas / Consolidado)"
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings/525420010/export-excel?tab=almacen|cobranza|consolidado
Gateway -> Service: exportClosingToExcel(transportOrderId: 525420010, tab: 'almacen')

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderHeader(525420010)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderHeader

Service -> WhClosingDB: 2. findWarehouseClosing(525420010)
WhClosingDB --> Service: whClosing

Service -> SalesItemsDB: 3. findSalesItemsWithProducts(525420010)
SalesItemsDB --> Service: salesItems[] (50 SKUs con cantidades y precios en Bs)

Service -> CollClosingDB: 4. findCollectionClosing(525420010)
CollClosingDB --> Service: collClosing

Service -> PaymentsDB: 5. findPaymentReferences(525420010)
PaymentsDB --> Service: paymentRefs[]

Service -> Engine: 6. generateXmlSpreadsheet(orderHeader, whClosing, salesItems, collClosing, paymentRefs, tab)
note right of Engine
  Genera libro Excel con formato financiero en Bs:
  - Tab 'almacen': Hoja 14 columnas con fórmulas =SUM(...)
  - Tab 'cobranza': Hoja con arqueo y conciliación
  - Tab 'consolidado': Libro Completo con 2 Hojas enlazadas
end note
Engine --> Service: excelBinaryStream

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (Content-Type: application/vnd.ms-excel; filename="Cierre_Logistico_525420010_Almacen.xls")
Gateway --> Web: File Download Stream (.xls)
Web --> User: Descarga automática de la hoja de cálculo en el navegador

== Flujo B: Descargar Acta Oficial en PDF (Multi-Página Vectorizado) ==

User -> Web: Clic en "Descargar PDF (Almacén / Cobranzas / Consolidado)"
Web -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/logistics/closings/525420010/export-pdf?tab=cobranza
Gateway -> Service: generateClosingOfficialPdf(transportOrderId: 525420010, tab: 'cobranza')

Service -> OrdersDB: 7. findOrderHeader(525420010)
OrdersDB --> Service: orderHeader

Service -> WhClosingDB: 8. findWarehouseClosingWithSignatures(525420010)
WhClosingDB --> Service: whClosingWithSignatures

Service -> CollClosingDB: 9. findCollectionClosingWithSignatures(525420010)
CollClosingDB --> Service: collClosingWithSignatures

Service -> Engine: 10. renderVectorizedOfficialPdf(orderHeader, whClosingWithSignatures, collClosingWithSignatures, tab)
note right of Engine
  Genera documento PDF vectorizado:
  - Encabezado: "Distribuidora DISCRUZ"
  - Título oficial: "ACTA DE CIERRE DE COBRANZAS" (o ALMACÉN)
  - Formato Horizontal (Landscape) multi-página
  - thead repetible en cabecera de cada página
  - Tablas financieras en 2 columnas sin cortes
  - 4 Cajas de firma amplias con espacio para firma física / sello
end note
Engine --> Service: pdfBinaryStream

Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (Content-Type: application/pdf; filename="Acta_Cierre_525420010_Cobranzas.pdf")
Gateway --> Web: PDF Binary Stream
Web --> User: Abre visor de impresión o descarga el documento legal PDF
@enduml
